{
  "slug": "tramp",
  "name": "Tramp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "TRAMP-like transparent remote execution for AI coding agents. Routes file and shell operations (bash, read, write, edit, glob, grep, ls) to remote targets via SSH or Docker. The agent stays local — tools execute remotely. Supports persistent SSH connections with native multiplexing, SFTP file I/O, bash and PowerShell shells, port forwarding, multi-target workflows, and network boundary context injection.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install tramp@claude-community` from `marcfargas/tramp`.\n\nTRAMP-like transparent remote execution for AI coding agents. MCP server that routes file and shell operations to remote targets via SSH or Docker.",
